{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPRankEquality"],"declarations":22,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_affine_slater_rigidity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_affine_slater_rigidity","kind":"theorem","line":262,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L262-L283","doc":"**`affine_slater_rigidity` is FALSE** — and this refutation\n*satisfies* its rank guard `rank Φ⋆ + rank S = n`.\n(`QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRankEquality.lean`) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_strict_complementarity_kernel_disjoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_strict_complementarity_kernel_disjoint","kind":"theorem","line":244,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L244-L260","doc":"**`strict_complementarity_kernel_disjoint` is FALSE** — with\n`Φ⋆ = 0` and `S = 0` every vector is in both kernels.\n(`QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRankEquality.lean`) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_SDPRankUniqueness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_SDPRankUniqueness","kind":"theorem","line":227,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L227-L242","doc":"**`SDPRankUniqueness` is FALSE** — Slater's condition holds too.\n(`QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean`) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_slater_strict_complementarity_kernel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_slater_strict_complementarity_kernel","kind":"theorem","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L206-L225","doc":"**`slater_strict_complementarity_kernel_axiom` is FALSE** — the\ncomplementarity-difference hypotheses hold vacuously when `S = 0`.\n(`QOU/MathlibExt/SDPRealUniqueness.lean`) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_strict_complementarity_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.not_strict_complementarity_unique","kind":"theorem","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L193-L204","doc":"**`strict_complementarity_unique_axiom` is FALSE.**\n(`QOU/MathlibExt/SDP.lean`) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP_rank_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP_rank_eq","kind":"theorem","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L179-L184","doc":"The rank guard `rank Φ⋆ + rank S = n` is **satisfied** here. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rank_d10","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rank_d10","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L173-L177","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rank_d01","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rank_d01","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L167-L171","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rsc2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rsc2","kind":"def","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L151-L165","doc":"`Φ⋆ = diag(0,1)`: PSD, feasible, and objective-matching, since\n`tr(diag(1,0) * diag(0,1)) = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP_dualSlack","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP_dualSlack","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L147-L149","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rankSDP","kind":"def","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L141-L145","doc":"Two dimensions, no constraints, `cost = diag(1,0)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.one_ne_zero_matrix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.one_ne_zero_matrix","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L132-L135","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rsc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.rsc","kind":"def","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L117-L130","doc":"The ℝ-layer strict-complementarity pair at `Φ⋆ = 0`.  Unlike\n`scPair` this one discharges *genuine* `dualSlack_psd` and\n`obj_eq_dualObj` fields — the extra structure does not help,\nbecause the dual slack is zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.scPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.scPair","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L103-L115","doc":"The generic strict-complementarity pair at `Φ⋆ = 0`.  The dual\nslack of `zeroSDP` is `0`, so dual feasibility and the zero gap hold\nfor the same reason as in `rsc` below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_feasible_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_feasible_zero","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L100-L101","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_feasible_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_feasible_one","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L97-L98","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_strictlyFeasible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_strictlyFeasible","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L94-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_dualSlack","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP_dualSlack","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L91-L92","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.zeroSDP","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L84-L89","doc":"One dimension, no constraints, **zero** cost: every PSD matrix is\noptimal and the dual slack is the zero matrix. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.psd_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.psd_zero","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L76-L80","doc":"The zero matrix is PSD over `ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.psd_diag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.psd_diag","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L65-L74","doc":"A real diagonal matrix with non-negative entries is PSD. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.posdef_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.posdef_one","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SDPUniquenessCounterexamples.lean#L54-L63","doc":"The identity matrix is positive-definite over `ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}